  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list of all residents and groups who own objects on the parcel at <b>pos</b> and with individual <a href="http://community.secondlife.com/t5/English-Knowledge-Base/Calculating-land-impact/ta-p/974163" target="_blank">land impact</a> used.</p>
  <p>The list is formatted as `<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank"> [key</a> ownerKey1, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a> agentImpact1, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a> ownerKey2, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a> agentImpact2, ... ]`, and sorted by agent/group <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">key</a> with a maximum of 100 strides.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>vector</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>vector</span></td>
          <td>Position / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/pos" target="_blank">pos</a></td>
